Package: epistract
Title: Extract Epidemiological Data from Unstructured Text
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("William", "Wirth", , "william@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: William Wirth [aut, cre]
Maintainer: William Wirth <william@example.com>
Description: Tools for extracting structured epidemiological fields from
    unstructured text with local language models. The package primarily
    targets single case investigation reports such as enteric disease case
    interviews with laboratory results, symptom timelines, exposure
    histories, travel history, and contact information. It wraps 'ellmer'
    structured outputs, adds epidemiology-specific type definitions,
    helpers for working with local Ollama models, and a dataframe-oriented
    extraction workflow that flattens nested outputs into dot-notated
    column names.
